# CODEOWNERS (example)
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the teams.
# See docs/sdd/22-git-and-commit-policy.md

# Default owner for everything in the repo
*                       @your-org/engineering

# Documentation and process
/docs/                  @your-org/architecture
docs/sdd/               @your-org/architecture

# CI and tooling must be reviewed by the platform team
/.github/workflows/     @your-org/platform
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @your-org/platform
docs/sdd/tools/         @your-org/platform

# Infrastructure and security-sensitive paths
/infra/                 @your-org/platform @your-org/security
/terraform/             @your-org/platform @your-org/security
/deploy/                @your-org/platform @your-org/security

# Authentication, payments, and data access
/src/auth/              @your-org/security
/src/payments/          @your-org/security @your-org/payments
/src/db/migrations/     @your-org/dba
